"},"bull":[{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $4.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 29.7% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-89.2% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $6.6m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 17.3% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"},{"text":"Debt of $193.4m against equity of $80.8m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1753539/000175353926000064/0001753539-26-000064-index.htm","accession":"0001753539-26-000064"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfin